              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua Abhanchaama na Abharawi bhagasabhëra abhantö amaitabhirio gö ÖMÖNENE, nawe köbhömenyo bhooe öbhöhoreeru kuriöbha köyö akaiigua amasabhi gaabho na kögaitabhiirria.",
          "type": "text",
